{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31555","headline":"湖阁晓晴寄呈从翁二首 一 · 李羣玉","name":"湖阁晓晴寄呈从翁二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岭日开寒雾，湖光荡霁华。\n风乌摇迳柳，水蝶恋幽花。\n蜀国地西极，吴门天一涯。\n轻舟栏下去，点点入湘霞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31555.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31555","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}